{"2633510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dinner with an Owl: Owl Observatory", "steam_appid": 2633510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/2839f55323bc91357513d086db62cda7.poster.avif?t=1784276590\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/2839f55323bc91357513d086db62cda7.webm?t=1784276590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/2839f55323bc91357513d086db62cda7.mp4?t=1784276590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Owl awaits you for another dinner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinner with an Owl: Owl Observatory shifts between nightmare and bizarre farce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change what you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or accept eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owl Observatory is a narrative-driven adventure focused on atmosphere, strange characters, and a looping storyline with subtle puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full </strong>professional <strong>voice acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie </strong>original <strong>soundtrack</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-painted</strong> backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-loop </strong>narrative with <strong>five different endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Familiar faces from <i>Dinner with an Owl</i> and <strong>new, strange characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple one-click interface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternity begins now - at the Owl Observatory!</strong>  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/2839f55323bc91357513d086db62cda7.poster.avif?t=1784276590\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/2839f55323bc91357513d086db62cda7.webm?t=1784276590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/2839f55323bc91357513d086db62cda7.mp4?t=1784276590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Owl awaits you for another dinner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinner with an Owl: Owl Observatory shifts between nightmare and bizarre farce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change what you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or accept eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owl Observatory is a narrative-driven adventure focused on atmosphere, strange characters, and a looping storyline with subtle puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full </strong>professional <strong>voice acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie </strong>original <strong>soundtrack</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-painted</strong> backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-loop </strong>narrative with <strong>five different endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Familiar faces from <i>Dinner with an Owl</i> and <strong>new, strange characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple one-click interface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternity begins now - at the Owl Observatory!</strong>  </p>", "short_description": "A surreal point-and-click adventure about time loops, perception, and a dinner you can never leave.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It’s a real joy getting to know more about Mr Brooks, thanks largely to some incredibly funny writing and excellent voice acting. He is a very odd old bird with an interesting way of looking at life. Highly recommended.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/header.jpg?t=1784276590", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784276590", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784276590", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX compatible card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["BoringSuburbanDad"], "publishers": ["BoringSuburbanDad"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "c